{"b":"Ps","c":54,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Save me, O God, by thy name, and judge me by thy strength.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O God”."},"x":[["1Sam.26.1",7,"r"],["Ps.20.1",6,"r"],["Prov.18.10",5,"r"],["Acts.4.12",5,"r"],["Ps.48.10",3,"r"],["Ps.79.9",3,"r"],["Isa.30.27",2,"r"],["Matt.1.21",2,"w"],["Exod.3.14",2,"r"],["Exod.3.15",2,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Hear my prayer, O God; give ear to the words of my mouth.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O God”."},"x":[["Ps.130.2",6,"r"],["Ps.13.3",3,"r"],["Ps.143.7",3,"r"],["Ps.55.1",2,"e"],["Ps.55.2",2,"r"],["Ps.5.1",1,"e"],["Ps.5.3",1,"w"]]},{"n":3,"t":"For strangers are risen up against me, and oppressors seek after my soul: they have not set God before them. Selah.","x":[["Ps.86.14",9,"e"],["Ps.36.1",6,"r"],["John.16.3",4,"r"],["Ps.53.4",4,"r"],["Ps.22.16",3,"r"],["Ps.40.14",3,"w"],["Ps.16.8",3,"r"],["Ps.59.3",3,"r"],["Ps.59.5",3,"w"],["Matt.27.20",2,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Behold, God is mine helper: the Lord is with them that uphold my soul.","it":[[12,14],[37,39]],"x":[["Heb.13.6",18,"w"],["Ps.118.6",16,"r"],["Ps.118.7",16,"r"],["Isa.41.10",15,"w"],["Ps.118.13",13,"r"],["Rom.8.31",12,"r"],["Isa.42.1",5,"e"],["1Chr.12.18",5,"r"],["Isa.50.7",5,"r"],["Isa.50.9",5,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"He shall reward evil unto mine enemies: cut them off in thy truth.","x":[["Ps.143.12",6,"e"],["Ps.89.49",6,"w"],["Ps.27.11",3,"w"],["Ps.94.23",3,"w"],["Ps.31.23",3,"r"],["Ps.137.8",2,"r"],["2Tim.4.14",2,"w"],["Ps.5.8",2,"w"],["Rev.18.6",2,"w"],["Ps.143.1",1,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"I will freely sacrifice unto thee: I will praise thy name, O LORD; for it is good.","it":[[71,76]],"tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.52.9",10,"e"],["Ps.7.17",8,"e"],["Ps.147.1",8,"e"],["Ps.140.13",7,"r"],["Ps.107.22",7,"w"],["Deut.12.6",6,"r"],["Deut.12.7",6,"r"],["Ps.21.13",6,"w"],["Ps.92.1",6,"r"],["Ps.116.17",6,"e"]]},{"n":7,"t":"For he hath delivered me out of all trouble: and mine eye hath seen his desire upon mine enemies.","it":[[68,78]],"x":[["Ps.59.10",10,"e"],["Ps.92.11",9,"q"],["Ps.112.8",9,"w"],["Ps.118.7",7,"w"],["2Tim.4.18",6,"r"],["Ps.34.19",5,"r"],["Ps.91.8",5,"r"],["Ps.58.10",5,"r"],["Ps.58.11",5,"r"],["Ps.37.34",5,"r"]]}],"title":"To the chief Musician on Neginoth, Maschil, A Psalm of David, when the Ziphims came and said to Saul, Doth not David hide himself with us?"}